WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.163 --> 00:00:14.624
upon a time, there was a girl named Goldilocks.

2
00:00:15.784 --> 00:00:18.225
Goldilocks loved walking in the woods.

3
00:00:19.445 --> 00:00:23.927
But sometimes she was not kind to the animals who lived there.

4
00:00:26.487 --> 00:00:28.428
She chased the birds and mice.

5
00:00:32.396 --> 00:00:40.282
She splashed the turtles and She hid the squirrels' acorns.

6
00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:50.269
One day Goldilocks was in the woods when she spotted a house.

7
00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:56.753
Goldilocks did not know that the house belonged to three bears.

8
00:00:57.754 --> 00:01:00.116
She opened the door and went inside.

9
00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.931
On the table were three bowls of porridge.

10
00:01:04.951 --> 00:01:09.655
"I'm hungry," Goldilocks thought.

11
00:01:11.497 --> 00:01:14.199
She tasted the porridge in the biggest bowl.

12
00:01:14.219 --> 00:01:17.562
"Too hot!"

13
00:01:20.144 --> 00:01:23.287
Next she tried the porridge in the medium bowl.

14
00:01:23.307 --> 00:01:26.170
"Too cold!"

15
00:01:29.168 --> 00:01:32.690
Then she tasted the porridge in the littlest bowl.

16
00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:35.371
"Just right!"

17
00:01:37.932 --> 00:01:41.133
After eating, Goldilocks went into the living room.

18
00:01:41.153 --> 00:01:44.194
"I'll take a rest," she thought.

19
00:01:45.315 --> 00:01:47.155
She sat in the biggest chair.

20
00:01:47.175 --> 00:01:51.097
"This chair is too hard!"

21
00:01:53.278 --> 00:01:54.678
She tried the next chair.

22
00:01:54.698 --> 00:01:57.580
"Too soft!"

23
00:01:59.672 --> 00:02:02.314
The smallest chair looked just right.

24
00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:06.597
But when Goldilocks sat in it—crash!

25
00:02:07.797 --> 00:02:08.778
The chair broke!

26
00:02:10.459 --> 00:02:11.800
Goldilocks sighed.

27
00:02:15.402 --> 00:02:17.243
just look for a bed," she thought.

28
00:02:18.463 --> 00:02:21.705
Upstairs, Goldilocks found three beds.

29
00:02:24.127 --> 00:02:25.768
The first one was too high.

30
00:02:31.564 --> 00:02:33.306
The second one was too low.

31
00:02:37.429 --> 00:02:43.635
The third one was right!"

32
00:02:44.055 --> 00:02:45.616
Goldilocks said happily.

33
00:02:46.497 --> 00:02:49.540
She climbed into the bed and pulled up the covers.

34
00:02:50.921 --> 00:02:53.503
Soon she was fast asleep.

35
00:02:55.605 --> 00:02:58.808
The three bears were on their way home from the stream.

36
00:03:01.356 --> 00:03:04.858
"That was a nice morning walk," Mama Bear said.

37
00:03:04.878 --> 00:03:08.199
"Now it's time for breakfast."

38
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.361
Papa Bear rubbed his belly.

39
00:03:11.381 --> 00:03:13.982
"I'm hungry."

40
00:03:14.002 --> 00:03:18.384
"Me too," Baby Bear said.

41
00:03:18.404 --> 00:03:21.145
"I love porridge."

42
00:03:23.266 --> 00:03:26.567
But when they arrived home, Mama gasped.

43
00:03:28.804 --> 00:03:31.246
"Someone tasted my porridge!"

44
00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:34.849
Papa growled.

45
00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:38.712
"Someone tasted my porridge too!"

46
00:03:38.732 --> 00:03:44.757
"Well, someone tasted my porridge—and ate it all up!"

47
00:03:45.238 --> 00:03:46.078
Baby said.

48
00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.262
Mama pointed to their chairs.

49
00:03:50.282 --> 00:03:53.604
"Someone sat in our chairs!"

50
00:03:53.624 --> 00:03:57.608
"Look!" Baby sniffed.

51
00:03:59.276 --> 00:04:02.758
"My chair is broken!"

52
00:04:04.198 --> 00:04:06.559
The three bears hurried upstairs.

53
00:04:11.281 --> 00:04:14.563
"Somebody was sleeping in my bed!"

54
00:04:15.003 --> 00:04:15.763
Papa said.

55
00:04:15.783 --> 00:04:20.405
"Somebody was sleeping in my bed!"

56
00:04:20.985 --> 00:04:21.765
Mama said.

57
00:04:21.785 --> 00:04:26.007
"Somebody is sleeping in my bed!"

58
00:04:26.527 --> 00:04:27.608
Baby cried.

59
00:04:30.845 --> 00:04:35.827
"Ahh!" Baby Bear's scream woke up Goldilocks.

60
00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:41.170
no!" she cried.

61
00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:46.933
"Bears!" Goldilocks hopped out of bed and raced downstairs.

62
00:04:48.334 --> 00:04:50.955
She ran through the woods as fast as she could.

63
00:04:52.916 --> 00:04:54.998
At last she was home.

64
00:04:58.559 --> 00:05:02.384
After that, Goldilocks still loved walking in the woods.

65
00:05:03.706 --> 00:05:07.471
But now she was always kind to the animals!
